{
  "ja208:1.1": "Enough with these mangos, ",
  "ja208:1.2": "with black plums and jack fruits ",
  "ja208:1.3": "Which are across the sea, ",
  "ja208:1.4": "my fig tree is better. ",
  "ja208:2.1": "Great your body, ",
  "ja208:2.2": "but your wisdom is not the same, ",
  "ja208:2.3": "The crocodile tricked me, ",
  "ja208:2.4": "now go where’er you will. "
}
